        h2 Keyboard Shortcuts
        text ?
        text Show this help dialog
        text /
        row
          text S
          text /
        text Focus the search field
        text ↑
        text Move up in search results
        text ↓
        text Move down in search results
        text /
        row
          text ←
          text →
        text Switch result tab (when results focused)
        text ⏎
        text Go to active search result
        text /
        row
          text +
          text =
        text Expand all sections
        text -
        text Collapse all sections
        text _
        text Collapse all sections, including impl blocks
      col
        h2 Search Tricks
        text For a full list of all search features, take a look .
        link here https://doc.rust-lang.org/1.99.1/rustdoc/read-documentation/search.html
        text "Prefix searches with a type followed by a colon (e.g., fn:) to restrict the search to a given item kind."
        text Accepted kinds are: fn, mod, struct, enum, trait, type, macro, and constant.
        text "Search functions by type signature (e.g., vec -> usize or -> vec or String, enum:Cow -> bool)"
        text "You can look for items with an exact name by putting double quotes around your request: \"string\""
        text Look for functions that accept or return  and  by writing square brackets (e.g.,  or )
        link slices https://doc.rust-lang.org/1.99.1/std/primitive.slice.html
        link arrays https://doc.rust-lang.org/1.99.1/std/primitive.array.html
        text -> [u8]
        text [] -> Option
        text "Look for items inside another one by searching for a path: vec::Vec"
